    "title": "The Trivia Bar",
    "description": "The Trivia Bar brings the fun of a bar trivia night to the palm of your hand! Our categories include the most binge-worthy TV shows, cult classic movies, 80's and 90's music, pop culture and more! Play in our featured contests agains hundreds or even thousands, play head to head against a friend, or in a small field contest. Once you sign up, click \"interested\" in all of your favorite categories and we'll notify you when an interested category has an event!",
